      "sourceTextSha256": "f980791fc9a775905f0f9c192e036ea85c69f528bd28eaa632917dea0516e7a7",
      "text": "A private excursion (6 hours) to the Chicaque Natural Park, a majestic cloud forest just outside Bogotá, with more than 18 km of trails among mountains, waterfalls and viewpoints, and seven types of forest home to over 300 bird species and 20 mammals. A specialised guide accompanies the walk to the refuge, followed by a traditional lunch. Uneven terrain; not suitable for people with reduced mobility.",
