    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "303b796abd69f7ef028f2ca4f7d40cb7b9ad164634a9921d644de6254877f951",
      "text": "Charter flight to La Macarena, where your local guide welcomes you with a brief introduction to the national park. A 20-minute canoe ride on the Guayabero River, then a 45-minute walk to El Mirador, a viewpoint over the Guiana Shield, and a 45-minute hike to Caño Cristalitos, with its crystal-clear water and Macarenia clavigera: time for a swim and lunch. About 50 minutes back to the river and 15 minutes by canoe to La Manigua Lodge, where monkeys may be seen from the cabins. Dinner at the lodge.",
